error[E0066]: `Tagged` inherits two different functions named `name`
  --> tests/ui/08-interfaces/declaration/embedded_signature_conflict.cheby:14:11
   |
7  |   fn name(Self) -> String
   |      ---- `Named::name` is `fn name(Self) -> String`
...
11 |   fn name(Self) -> Int
   |      ---- `Numbered::name` is `fn name(Self) -> Int`
...
14 | interface Tagged: Named + Numbered
   |           ^^^^^^ embeds both
   |
   = note: embedded interfaces may require the same function only with identical signatures, so no type could satisfy this interface (§8.3)
   = help: rename one of the functions

